  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower Women: Help mothers have job opportunities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to accompany and strengthen mothers, that live in low-income neighborhoods, in the development of employability skills. We propose training in the trade of sewing and textile production while we accompany them in the development of their own entrepreneurial skills. This will allow them to improve their income while gaining economic stability and independence.</narrative>
  </description>
